+- Transferring a user (`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer`): only an org
+  admin of `{orgID}` may do it (a user of another organization → 404, a
+  non-admin → 403). The user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404), and
+  `toOrgId` must be a different, existing organization (else 400). To keep
